# WGX (WebGPU)

- Opt-in via `apex26.gfxBackend=webgpu`; GLX is the default fallback.
- Soft-adapter gate refuses Dawn/SwiftShader / empty adapter info unless
  `apex26.gfxWgxAllowSoftware=1` — players get GLX, not a white canvas.
- SwiftShader WebGPU EXECUTES: `node tools/wgx-capture.mjs <track>` returns
  real pixels (offscreen mode — `apex26.gfxWgxOffscreen=1`; the swapchain
  present path is blank in headless and its first `getCurrentTexture()` call
  breaks `mapAsync` device-wide). Not a performance oracle; MSAA paths never
  run on software (forced MSAA 1) — those rely on the lifecycle unit guards.
- Load skill `webgpu-debug` for WGSL / device-loss / `wgx-validate.mjs`.
- Live probe: `mcp-probe` + `node tools/mcp-cli.mjs probe --backend webgpu`.
  Never use github.io from Chrome in this container — tinyfish for deploy.
